        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tuesday, August 4, 2026 7:30 p.m. | $102.50 It all started on the outskirts of Berlin in a small chapel, 3 part harmony with my mates Jermaine Holmes on drums and vocals, the mighty Jim Wilson on bass and vocals, Lanois on guitar and vocals.  The chapel acoustics were such that the vocals sounded beautiful, we"
      },
