        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "! Thursday Aug 13th, 3-7 pm at the Christ Church Anglican, 34 Boucher St. E, Meaford A SITE-SPECIFIC CONTEMPORARY ART SHOW &#8211; ALL WELCOME! Building on the success of last year’s Art in the Wild, 20+ talented artists are bringing a brand-new vision to life with Art in the Pews. For one day only, the"
