    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "1:00 pm Ages 8+ Please register in advance. Participants will learn foundational hand-sewing skills in this fun beginner-friendly water-themed workshop where they will create imaginative fish; ‘sock salmon’ and octopus; ‘socktopus’. Guided through the basics of threading a needle, tying knots, and making simple stitches, participants will transform everyday materials into unique handmade creations. This"
      },
      {
