        "@value": "Tote Bag Printing"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Get creative and explore a fun printmaking technique in this hands-on fabric bag decorating program! Participants will use apples and paint to create colourful stamped designs on reusable fabric bags, turning simple materials into unique works of art. By cutting apples into different shapes and patterns, participants will experiment with texture, colour, and composition while"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Get creative and explore a fun printmaking technique in this hands-on fabric bag decorating program! Participants will use apples and paint to create colourful stamped designs on reusable fabric bags,"
      }
