        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nominations for the Election in the Municipality of Meaford opens May 1, 2026 and closes at 2:00 p.m. on August 21, 2026. If you&#8217;re passionate about shaping our community’s future, now is the time to step forward and make a difference. Local leadership matters—your voice, your vision, and your commitment can help guide the Municipality"
      },
