        "@value": "Fri. August 22 at 7:30 p.m. $60 An Evening of John Prine Celebrating his 80th birthday Celebrate the life, music, and enduring legacy of legendary songwriter John Prine in In Spite of Ourselves: An Evening of John Prine — a heartfelt tribute marking what would have been John’s 80th birthday. Featuring an all-star lineup of"
      },
