        "@value": "The Free Label"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "August 28, 2026. $50 The Free Label is a six-member band from Toronto, Canada, blending 70s disco, 90s R&amp;B, and high-energy funk into an electrifying, dance-driven experience. Since their breakout 2019 single &#8220;All Night,&#8221; they’ve toured Europe, North America, and Australia, building a loyal fanbase. Notable Canadian festivals include Mariposa Folk Festival, Laketown Shakedown, and"
      },
