        "@value": "Drop-in on Tuesdays2:00 &#8211; 5:00 pm or by appointmentWeston Family Foundation RoomLife Directions specializes in providing individualized, one-on-one employment supports to jobseekers facing barriers to employment. Interested individuals can book an appointment by calling 519-378-5514 or emailing lifedirections@segss.com"
