        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Shoreline Cleanups Stopping Litter and Macroplastics from Becoming Microplastics in Georgian Bay Water Each year we remove approximately 1,000 pounds of litter from the Georgian Bay shores. Imagine what Georgian Bay would look like without these efforts, and you&#8217;ll know why this work is necessary.  Further to the importance of cleaning our beach areas, this"
      },
