        "@value": "Rapid Access Addiction Medicine (RAAM) Clinics By Appointment:Wednesday, July 8 and 221:00 &#8211; 3:00 pmPlease call 519-376-5666 ext. 1 to schedule an appointment.Walk-in: Friday, July 3 and 1711:00 am &#8211; 1:00 pmOntario Trillium Foundation RoomRAAM Clinics provide swift access to medically assisted, integrative, and client-centered care for individuals at any stage of addiction or recovery."
