        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Walk the Length of the OdysseyFriday, June 19 until Friday, August 28Please register to participateA 10-week (not years) community movement challenge! Walk, run, bike, rollerblade&#8230; just get moving! Keep track of your steps or km travelled and submit them weekly to asolecki@meaford.ca. The participant who travels the furthest will win a heroic-age prize. Let&#8217;s see"
      },
