        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Queer Fest Saturday, July 25 1:00 &#8211; 3:00 pm Library Parkette Drop-in Time to celebrate our 2SLGBTQIA+ community! Whether you are queer, questioning, or a responsible ally, you are welcome here. Let us share our love and joy for our community! Join us for some fun in the sun with games, music, art, and more!"
      },
