        "@value": "9/13/2026 2:00 p.m. $20 reg $15 Student (under 19) plus $3 ticketing fee. The Meaford Culture Foundation (MCF) is thrilled to present We Lend a Hand: The Forgotten Story of Ontario Farmerettes, a documentary film that tells the extraordinary story of 40,000 teenaged girls who volunteered on Canadian farms and helped to win the Second"
