        "@value": "Practical AI Skills for Everyday Life: Use It, Don’t be Fooled by ItThursday, June 18Join us at 11:00 am OR 5:30 pmFriends of the Meaford Library RoomPlease register in advanceAI is everywhere! Whether you’re brand-new to AI or you’ve experimented with tools like ChatGPT,this session will help you get practical value fast.Expect quick live demos"
