    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "7:30Pm $55 June 20, 2026 STRANGE MAGIC is the authentic re-creation of legendary &#8217;70s rock band ELO (Electric Light Orchestra), a multi-media show featuring notonly music but background imagery and film. A 8-piece group of multi-instrumentalists perform all of the sounds used in a real ELO show,with vintage keyboards, live cellos, and intricate vocal arrangements."
