    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Saturday, June 27, 7:30 pm $50 The Legendary Downchild Blues Band played the final shows of their farewell tour in Nov. 2024. The Hogtown Allstars are the next chapter. Formed in 2013 to perform during the main bands winter hiatus, HTA released their debut recording Hogwild in 2022. DCBB members Chuck Jackson, Gary Kendall, Pat"
      },
