    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Oct 16, 2026. 7:30 pm $65.00 Reg For almost three decades now HOTEL CALIFORNIA have been recreating the legendary sound of THE EAGLES, and thrilling audiences all over the world. Don&#8217;t be fooled by the rest! The band set the bar in 1986, and they’ve remained the industry leading substitute for The Eagles ever since."
      },
